{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20495","headline":"省试行不由径 · 张籍","name":"省试行不由径","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田里有微径，贤人不复行。\n孰知求捷步，又恐异端成。\n从易衆所欲，安邪患亦生。\n谁能达天道，共此竞前程。\n子羽有遗迹，孔门传旧声。\n今逢大君子，士节自光明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}